全世界最废柴的小偷
34秒钟。
the world's most
useless burglar.

1058
00:51:00,067 --> 00:51:03,167
三、二、一，开始！
Three, two, one, go.

1059
00:51:03,200 --> 00:51:07,400
大街上到处都是全顺，
测试这车到底有多好撬很有现实意义。
There's a lot of Transits
around. It's important to see
how easy it is to get in.

1060
00:51:12,667 --> 00:51:15,100
（哈蒙德和梅爆笑）
(HAMMOND AND MAY
LAUGHING LOUDLY)

1061
00:51:15,133 --> 00:51:18,833
-才用了10秒！
-他直接走过去，门就开了！
-That was 10 seconds.
-He walked up and it opened.

1062
00:51:20,067 --> 00:51:23,800
重头戏来了。
终极挑战！
This is it.
It's the final challenge.

1063
00:51:23,833 --> 00:51:26,067
“这是一场‘猫鼠游戏’，
"It's a game of
cops and robbers

1064
00:51:26,100 --> 00:51:27,800
“赛道是Top Gear短赛道。
"round the Top Gear
short circuit.

1065
00:51:27,833 --> 00:51:32,100
“你先发车，
20秒后警车出发追捕。
"You start,
then 20 seconds later a
police car will give chase.

1066
00:51:32,133 --> 00:51:34,767
“能在警车前面
撑最久的人获胜。”
"The person who
stays in front
the longest wins."

1067
00:51:34,800 --> 00:51:36,067
谁开警车？
Who's driving the police car?

1068
00:51:36,067 --> 00:51:39,067
上面写着：斯提格警长！
Says here it's
Detective Inspector Stig!

1069
00:51:40,233 --> 00:51:42,133
克拉克森：斯提格开的是一辆标配的
CLARKSON: Stig would be
driving a standard

1070
00:51:42,167 --> 00:51:45,300
1.6升沃克斯豪尔
雅特巡逻警车。
1.6-litre Vauxhall
Astra panda car.

1071
00:51:45,333 --> 00:51:49,567
跟我们的小破面包比，那简直就是布加迪威航。
A Bugatti Veyron
compared to our vans.

1072
00:51:49,600 --> 00:51:51,367
哈蒙德：杰里米第一个上场。
HAMMOND: Jeremy went first.

1073
00:51:51,400 --> 00:51:52,500
刺激起来了！
This is exciting!

1074
00:51:56,900 --> 00:51:59,600
梅：看，“神偷”克拉克森带着赃物开溜了！
MAY: There goes Fingers
Clarkson with his haul!

1075
00:51:59,633 --> 00:52:02,967
好，话说在上世纪70年代，
Okay, now in the 1970s,

1076
00:52:03,067 --> 00:52:06,367
全英国80%的银行劫案，
80% of all bank jobs

1077
00:52:06,400 --> 00:52:09,767
劫匪逃跑选用的座驾都是福特全顺。
featured a Ford Transit van
as a getaway vehicle.

1078
00:52:09,800 --> 00:52:13,133
哈蒙德：20秒后，“苏格兰场警长”斯提格出动了！
HAMMOND: Twenty seconds later,
Stig of the Yard set off.

1079
00:52:14,867 --> 00:52:17,533
高速切入全油弯！漂亮！
Through the Follow Through.
Oh, yes!

1080
00:52:18,633 --> 00:52:20,967
（警报长鸣）
(SIREN BLARING)

1081
00:52:21,067 --> 00:52:23,267
哎呀，车门掉了！
我的车门没了！
Oh, the door's gone!
My door's gone!

1082
00:52:25,200 --> 00:52:27,400
他看起来真是蠢透了！
He looks such a pillock!

1083
00:52:27,433 --> 00:52:30,167
克拉克森：不过，
减重倒是件好事。
CLARKSON: Shedding weight,
however, was good.

1084
00:52:32,067 --> 00:52:34,600
斯提格警督，
被远远甩在了后面。
Detective Inspector Stig,
well behind.

1085
00:52:36,500 --> 00:52:40,700
终点线近在眼前了。
马贝拉，我来啦！
The finish line was in sight.
Marbella, here I come!

1086
00:52:40,733 --> 00:52:42,733
噢，不！不要啊！
Oh, no! No!

1087
00:52:42,767 --> 00:52:44,067
哈蒙德：警察斯提格追上来了！
HAMMOND: Police Stig!

1088
00:52:44,067 --> 00:52:47,267
克拉克森：不！不！不！
CLARKSON: No! No! No!

1089
00:52:51,067 --> 00:52:53,200
克拉克森：我没冲过去。
CLARKSON: I didn't make it.

1090
00:52:53,233 --> 00:52:55,433
太精彩了。
这简直够得上演《警务风云》了。
That was excellent.
That was worthy of The Bill.

1091
00:52:55,467 --> 00:52:58,200
克拉克森：下一位，詹姆斯·克雷！
CLARKSON: Next up, James Kray!

1092
00:52:58,233 --> 00:53:00,300
（《警务风云》主题曲响起）
(THE BILL THEME MUSIC PLAYING)

1093
00:53:00,333 --> 00:53:03,067
-他逮住他了！
-（哈蒙德大笑）
-He's caught him!
-(HAMMOND LAUGHING)

1094
00:53:03,067 --> 00:53:04,833
多么壮观的景象啊。
What a majestic sight.

1095
00:53:07,600 --> 00:53:09,367
警察斯提格出发了！
Off goes Police Stig!

1096
00:53:09,400 --> 00:53:10,933
（警笛呼啸）
(SIRENS BLARING)

1097
00:53:15,867 --> 00:53:17,433
我过了锤头弯了。
I've made the Hammerhead.

1098
00:53:17,467 --> 00:53:19,600
-哈蒙德：詹姆斯以前
过得去锤头弯吗？
-过不去。
-HAMMOND: Has James ever gone
round the Hammerhead?
-No.

1099
00:53:19,633 --> 00:53:21,467
梅：刹车。重重踩刹车。
MAY: Braking. Braking hard.

1100
00:53:26,267 --> 00:53:29,367
梅：好吧，他抓到我了！
哈蒙德：彻底玩完了！
MAY: Well, he's got me!
HAMMOND: It's all over!

1101
00:53:29,400 --> 00:53:31,933
我坦白交代。
抓得漂亮，我认栽！
I'll come cleanly.
It's a fair cop!

1102
00:53:31,967 --> 00:53:33,067
克拉克森：他跑得
比我想象的要好。
CLARKSON: He did better
than I thought.

1103
00:53:33,100 --> 00:53:35,933
-你这局没准能表现得很棒。
-对啊！
-You might do quite well here.
-Yeah!

1104
00:53:37,567 --> 00:53:38,900
爽！
Yeah!

1105
00:53:38,933 --> 00:53:41,833
-短轴距。
-简直像枚小火箭。
-Short wheel-base.
-Just like a little rocket.

1106
00:53:41,867 --> 00:53:43,767
哈蒙德：好，第一个弯。
现在，这可是中置引擎。
HAMMOND: So, first corner.
Now, it's mid-engine.

1107
00:53:43,800 --> 00:53:47,267
我想我要给它来上一手
经典的
斯堪的纳维亚钟摆漂移。
I reckon I'm going to give it
a bit of the old
Scandinavian flick.

1108
00:53:53,367 --> 00:53:55,533
他翻车了！
他把车开翻了！
He's rolled it!
He's rolled it over!

1109
00:53:58,367 --> 00:54:01,167
-他出局了！他输了。
-那意味着我是第二名！
-He's out! He's lost.
-That means I'm second!

1110
00:54:02,967 --> 00:54:05,900
所以，呃……他可能已经死了。
So, um... He could be dead.

1111
00:54:05,933 --> 00:54:08,933
好吧，事故现场正好有一辆警车，
所以……
Well, there's a police car at
the scene of the accident,
so...

1112
00:54:08,967 --> 00:54:12,633
要是他真死了，而你想在
《Top Gear》找份差事，
不妨给我们写信，信封上写：
If he is dead, and you fancy
a job on Top Gear,
why not write to us at:

1113
00:54:12,667 --> 00:54:14,800
“我比当年的
理查德·哈蒙德
强多了……”
"I'm better than
Richard Hammond
was..."

1114
00:54:14,833 --> 00:54:15,833
（如果你知道后来发生了什么，这简直是个地狱级烂梗）
(If you know what happened next, this
is a cosmically awful joke)

1115
00:54:15,833 --> 00:54:18,133
我刚才那一下
可能稍微有点冲过头了。
I may have
over-cooked that a bit.

1116
00:54:18,167 --> 00:54:21,433
地址是伦敦伍德巷BBC大楼，
邮编 W12 7TS。
BBC Wood Lane, London,
W12 7TS.

1117
00:54:21,467 --> 00:54:24,467
（警笛呼啸）
(SIREN BLARING)

1118
00:54:24,500 --> 00:54:27,167
（观众鼓掌）
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

1119
00:54:31,133 --> 00:54:32,300
芜湖！
Whoo!

1120
00:54:32,333 --> 00:54:33,767
搞定！
Boom!

1121
00:54:33,800 --> 00:54:39,667
好啦！
该把分数算一算，
看看到底是谁赢了。
Right!
It is time to add up the
scores and see who's won.

1122
00:54:39,700 --> 00:54:42,233
没错，直线加速赛、
Yep, now, we've already
filled in the scores
for the drag race,

1123
00:54:42,267 --> 00:54:45,433
装载测试和防盗测试的分数
已经填好了。不过这跟车测试，
情况可就有点微妙了。
the loading and the thief
test. The tailgating, though,
is where it gets tricky.

1124
00:54:45,467 --> 00:54:47,667
只要跟车距离低于……
每近一厘米得一分。
You get a point
for every centimetre under...

1125
00:54:47,700 --> 00:54:49,833
-距离低于十厘米，每近一厘米得一分。
-对。
-Every centimetre
under 10 centimetres.
-Right.

1126
00:54:49,867 --> 00:54:53,067
所以我得了负零点五分。
So I was minus a half.

1127
00:54:53,067 --> 00:54:59,600
理查德，你得了九分。
至于詹姆斯，你是
负四百万分。
Richard, you were nine.
And, James, you were
minus 4 million.

1128
00:54:59,633 --> 00:55:00,800
哈蒙德：没错。
HAMMOND: Yeah.

1129
00:55:00,833 --> 00:55:02,067
-什么？等会儿！
-（观众笑声）
-What? Hang on a minute.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

1130
00:55:02,100 --> 00:55:05,300
就因为没跟车贴屁股，
我就倒扣四百万分？！
I lose 4 million points
for not tailgating?

1131
00:55:05,333 --> 00:55:06,867
一点都没错。
That's exactly right.

1132
00:55:06,900 --> 00:55:09,233
而且换车门挑战你也是一分没捞着，
And you don't get anything
for the door challenge,

1133
00:55:09,267 --> 00:55:13,067
因为你那会儿还在慢吞吞给扳手起名字呢。
那轮是谁赢了来着？
'cause you were still
naming all your spanners.
Who won that one?

1134
00:55:13,067 --> 00:55:15,067
是我！
换车门是我赢了。
It was me!
I won the door challenge.

1135
00:55:15,067 --> 00:55:17,333
等会儿！你那是拿大力胶带粘上去的！
Hang on! You put that on
with gaffer tape.

1136
00:55:17,367 --> 00:55:20,533
那又怎样？整支英国陆军
可都是靠大力胶带
粘在一块儿的。
So? The whole British Army is
held together
with gaffer tape.

1137
00:55:20,567 --> 00:55:24,833
杰里米，你那门根本打不开。
打不开的玩意儿，
根本不能叫门。
Jeremy, it didn't open.
And if something doesn't open,
it's not a door.

1138
00:55:24,867 --> 00:55:26,400
-梅：他说得对。
-打开过好吗！
-MAY: He's right.
-It did open.

1139
00:55:26,433 --> 00:55:29,333
-根本没开。
-整扇掉下来的时候就算开了！
-It didn't.
-It did when it fell off.

1140
00:55:29,367 --> 00:55:30,833
这也算？太扯了吧！
He can't claim that!

1141
00:55:30,867 --> 00:55:34,833
行吧。
现场有谁觉得杰里米
在车门挑战里赢了？
All right.
Who here thinks Jeremy won
with the door?

1142
00:55:34,867 --> 00:55:36,933
谁觉得是杰里米赢了？
举手我看看。
Who thinks Jeremy won that?
Hands up.

1143
00:55:36,967 --> 00:55:40,267
那谁觉得老老实实用螺栓装上车门的我赢了？全场都举手了。
Who thinks I won, fitting my
door on with bolts? Everybody.

1144
00:55:40,300 --> 00:55:43,133
-（全场欢呼）
-我得一分！
-(ALL CHEERING)
-One for me!

1145
00:55:43,767 --> 00:55:45,467
你输了。
You lost.

1146
00:55:45,500 --> 00:55:47,100
你确实输了。认输吧。
You did. You lost.

1147
00:55:47,133 --> 00:55:49,067
行吧，我输得起。
Fair enough. I'm not sore.

1148
00:55:49,067 --> 00:55:52,500
-后面分还多着呢。第一名三分，所以你拿三分。
-而你得了个零蛋。
-Plenty more ground here.
We're three. So you get three.
-And you get nought.

1149
00:55:52,533 --> 00:55:56,067
我都不知道你在这儿得意个什么劲，
挂零大侠！我拿了两分。
I don't know why
you're gloating
Nought Man! And I get two.

1150
00:55:56,067 --> 00:55:57,833
接下来是警车追逐赛。
Now, the police chase.

1151
00:55:57,867 --> 00:56:01,567
那妥妥是我得三分。
詹姆斯表现不错，拿两分。
That would be
a big three for me.
James you did well, two.

1152
00:56:01,600 --> 00:56:04,633
-至于你嘛，一分。
-才一分？！
-And you, one.
-One?

1153
00:56:04,667 --> 00:56:08,600
-你的小面包都翻车底朝天了！
-我都差点没命了好吗！
-Your van rolled over.
-I could've been killed!

1154
00:56:08,633 --> 00:56:11,900
-那又怎样？就算摔死了你还是输了。
-一点没错！
-So? You'd have still lost.
-Exactly!

1155
00:56:11,933 --> 00:56:13,800
就是嘛。现在我们把这些分数加起来。
Exactly. And now we've got
to add these up.

1156
00:56:13,833 --> 00:56:17,300
所以是五分、六分、
五点五分、七点五分、
So, it's five, six,
five and a half,
seven and a half,

1157
00:56:17,333 --> 00:56:19,700
十点五分。没算错吧？
ten and a half. Okay?

1158
00:56:19,733 --> 00:56:22,333
理查德，三分、四分……
等会儿。
Richard, three, four...
Wait a minute.

1159
00:56:22,367 --> 00:56:23,933
这算术把你脑细胞烧干了吧？
Stretching you, this,
isn't it?

1160
00:56:23,967 --> 00:56:25,633
二十分。行了吧？
Twenty. Okay?

1161
00:56:25,667 --> 00:56:29,800
然后，詹姆斯，你拿了二、三、
四、五、六、七……
And, James, you're two, three,
four, five, six, seven...

1162
00:56:30,400 --> 00:56:31,433
三百万……
3 million...

1163
00:56:31,467 --> 00:56:36,400
抱歉，是负3,999,993分。
Sorry, minus 3,999,993.

1164
00:56:38,967 --> 00:56:41,800
-哈蒙德：对啊，你混得可真够惨的，是吧？
-这就是你的最终得分。
-HAMMOND: Yeah. It didn't go
well for you, did it?
-Is what you scored.

1165
00:56:41,833 --> 00:56:45,600
-你才混得惨呢。
-不过，我们还有
最后一项挑战，
-You're not going well.
-However, there was
one more challenge,

1166
00:56:45,633 --> 00:56:47,733
因为制片人让我们每人
because
the producers told us to put

1167
00:56:47,767 --> 00:56:51,233
在报纸上各登一条
“带车拉活”的广告。
a "man with a van"
type ad in a newspaper each.

1168
00:56:51,267 --> 00:56:53,067
而且广告每收到一条回复，
And that we would each
get one point

1169
00:56:53,100 --> 00:56:54,933
我们就能得到一分。
for every response
we got from our ad.

1170
00:56:54,967 --> 00:56:58,533
确实如此。
那么，詹姆斯，
你的广告是怎么写的？
Yes, we did.
So, James, what was
your advert?

1171
00:56:58,567 --> 00:57:00,367
我的广告是：
My ad was:

1172
00:57:00,400 --> 00:57:04,833
“带车拉活。LDV Convoy，
配备完全正常的
自动门系统。
"Man with van. LDV Convoy with
fully-functioning automatic
door system.

1173
00:57:04,867 --> 00:57:09,233
-“由沉稳、细腻、受过专业古典训练的钢琴家驾驶。”
-哈蒙德：挺好嘛。
-"Driven by steady, sensitive,
classically-trained pianist."
-HAMMOND: Nice.

1174
00:57:09,267 --> 00:57:12,067
相当不错。
别忘了，每收到一条回复得一分。
Pretty good.
Remember, it's one
point for each reply.

1175
00:57:12,100 --> 00:57:16,933
詹姆斯，这是你追回点分数的机会了。
收到几条回复？
A chance for you to claw back
some points, here, James.
How many replies?

1176
00:57:16,967 --> 00:57:18,367
-零条。
-哈蒙德：很好。
-None.
-HAMMOND: Right.

1177
00:57:18,400 --> 00:57:20,933
那你基本彻底出局了。
So you're pretty much out.

1178
00:57:20,967 --> 00:57:22,067
理查德，你的广告是……
Richard, your ad was...

1179
00:57:22,067 --> 00:57:24,200
我的广告是这么写的：
My ad ran like this:

1180
00:57:24,233 --> 00:57:30,100
“司机自带货车。空间出奇宽敞。
非常适合住在狭窄街道的客户。
"Driver with van. Surprisingly
spacious. Would suit anyone
who lives at narrow street.

1181
00:57:30,133 --> 00:57:34,767
“得益于F1风格的中置发动机布局，保证极速送达。”
它确实是中置。
"Speedy delivery guaranteed
thanks to F1-style mid-engine
layout." Which it's got.

1182
00:57:34,800 --> 00:57:38,567
-这倒是事实。
-无可否认。
收到几条回复？
-Which it has.
-No denying that.
How many replies?

1183
00:57:39,600 --> 00:57:40,733
-一条。
-一条。
-One.
-One.

1184
00:57:40,767 --> 00:57:42,800
所以你现在实际拿到了21分。
So you actually now get 21.

1185
00:57:42,833 --> 00:57:46,733
我看这帮“带车拉活”的行当，
并没有我们想象中那么赚钱啊。
I think this "man with a van"
malarkey is not as well-paid
as we might have imagined.

1186
00:57:46,767 --> 00:57:47,933
-看来不太景气，是吧？
-确实不行。
-It's not brilliant, is it?
-Not really.

1187
00:57:47,967 --> 00:57:50,067
-行了，念你的吧。
-那……
-Come on. Let's hear it.
-So...

1188
00:57:50,067 --> 00:57:52,233
我的嘛。啊，对，
长话短说，
简单明了。
Mine. Ah, yeah,
very quickly,
very simple.

1189
